message: "If this evidence release informs your work, cite this repository."
title: "CodexProLong: evidence from a persistent EinsteinArena agent campaign"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Weatherhead
    given-names: James
repository-code: "https://github.com/JamesWeatherhead/CodexProLong"
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-08-15
version: 0.2.0
abstract: >-
  A curated evidence release from a long-horizon EinsteinArena campaign using
  OpenAI Codex, persistent filesystem memory, web and literature research, and
  problem-specific program synthesis. The frozen release records five
  domain-valid first-place constructions, receipts, hashes, provenance, and a
  selected exact-arithmetic certificate record; the production research system
  is not included in the current release tree.
